cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Kortext"
abstract: "A project brain for AI-driven development. Kortext turns a brief, or an existing codebase, into an approved analysis foundation by driving your own installed agent CLI (claude, codex, gemini) headlessly inside your repository, one document at a time and in dependency order. Every document lands as a draft for you to approve, question or send back; when they are all settled Kortext retires and the documents become the project's contract."
type: software
